[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429644\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429645\">7050A22</a>\n                                           (alternatively)</p><p>1. Release the retaining buttons (1a) using the special tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.878.077.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the mat under the cushion.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2053030.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the rod (1a) releasing it from the housing (1b) then from\nthe seat (1c) extracting the buckle (1d).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2053031.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the device is not\ndamaged.</p><p>Fit the rod in the buckle and attach it\nto the seats.</p><p>Position the mat and secure it using the\nretaining buttons.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429644\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429645\">7050A22</a>\n                                           (alternatively)</p>"]]